border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Biome\" title=\"Classic Biome\">Classic Biome</a> | Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Store\" title=\"Classic Store\">Classic Store</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$3,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">To play capture the flag</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.57.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">June 6th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p><i><big>\"Allows you to play capture the flag, a fun way to challenge your enemies. Joining a flag team will forcefully enable PVP for you, allowing you to use any PVP weapons you desire. Take flags from enemy teams and return them back to yours to earn points! Make sure to buy more than one flag post.\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Team Flag</b> item can be bought at the <a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Store\" title=\"Classic Store\">Classic Store</a> for $3,000. You can score a maximum of 25 points.\n</p><p>There are 5 commands:\n</p>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Colour\n</th>\n<th>Flag\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blue\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4a/Team_Flag_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20240610055657\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Team Flag Blue\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/4a/Team_Flag_Blue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20240610055657\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Team Flag Blue.png\" data-image-key=\"Team_Flag_Blue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Red\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/6a/Team_Flag_Red.png/revision/latest?cb=20240610055712\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Team Flag Red\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/6a/Team_Flag_Red.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20240610055712\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Team Flag Red.png\" data-image-key=\"Team_Flag_Red.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Orange\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/7b/Team_Flag_Orange.png/revision/latest?cb=20240610055735\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img